# Control of long-ident-class-1024. Book:
# Tests/Bugs/FORT-555217-VeryLongIdentifier.versetest, the shared
# definitions (line 18, valid on both VMs): a class of 960 characters with a
# field of 992. OpenVerse prints
#   field 42
# Run it alone (single mode), not in a batch: Epic's names for it may depend
# on the module that holds it.
# Epic's compiler (UEFN 43.12, ++Fortnite+Release-43.12-CL-60598086,
# 2026-11-19) admits it, and its Verse VM prints field 42, as OpenVerse
# does.
Class___ := class:
    Var_____:int = 42
    F():int = 1

Main():void =
    Obj := Class___{}
    Print("OVPROBE field {Obj.Var_____}")
